# local NodeBB markdown mirror
!docs/nodebb/
!docs/nodebb/*.md
!docs/nodebb/**/*.md

# shared local NodeBB test/runtime files:
# keep them versioned in GitHub so other developers can reproduce the local test setup.
# production sync is blocked by .deployignore instead of .gitignore.
